      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Back pain is one of the most common reasons cited for patients to see a physician. It also is the most frequently reported injury in golf. Any physician caring for golfers must therefore understand common causes of back pain, its treatment, and prevention strategies to reduce the burden of future injury."},
